                                "sense_id": "2b9f2fa6-5dde-3e7c-a60d-50671e842f12",
                                "text": "The earliest poisonous poison protection compounds, far from clinically recounted, do offer a record of the idea of the poisoned unpoisonable body developed by making and taking these formulas."
